 r←{x}Status y;rc;more;path;⎕TRAP;short;space;ind;branch;msg;cmd;aplNames;verbose;b;noAplNames
⍝ Reports all unstaged/uncommited/untracked files.\\
⍝ `y` must be one of:
⍝   * Fully qualfied name of a namespace that is an opened Cider project
⍝   * Fully qualified path to a Git-managed project
⍝ `x`, if specified, must be a one- or two-element vector of Booleans: `verbose` and `noAplNames`
⍝ * `verbose` defaults to 0
⍝   * verbose←1 gives a full report whith headers, usually useful only for the user command
⍝   * verbose←0 returns a matrix with 3 columns:
⍝     [;1] index indicators (one of ADM)
⍝     [;2] working area indicators (one of ADM)
⍝     [;3] the path
⍝ * `aplNames` defaults to 0. Ignored with verbose.
⍝   When set, a forth column with APL names is added when possible.
 ⎕TRAP←(811 'E' '⎕DMX.EM ⎕signal 811')(0 'N')
 x←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0 0}'x'
 (verbose noAplNames)←x,(≢x)↓0 1
 (space path)←EstablishProject y
 cmd←'status',(~verbose)/' --short'
 (rc more r)←path U.RunGitCommand cmd
 more U.Assert 0=rc
 ((≢'fatal:')↓more)U.Assert'fatal:'{⍺≢(≢⍺)↑⍵}more
 :If verbose
     ind←⍸∨/¨'On branch'∘⍷¨r
     branch←⊃¯1↑' '(≠⊆⊢)ind⊃r
     :If (⊂branch)∊'main' 'master'
         msg←∊(⎕UCS 13),U.Box{⍵{(⍵⍴'⌹')⍺(⍵⍴'⌹')}≢⍵}'⌹ On branch ',branch,' ⌹'
     :Else
         msg←'On branch ',branch
     :EndIf
     (ind⊃r)←msg
     r←⍪(⊂path{0<≢⍵:'Namespace: ',⍵ ⋄ 'Folder: ',⍺}space),⊆r
 :Else
     r←{(↑2↑¨⍵),3↓¨⍵}⍣(0<≢r)⊢r
     :If ~noAplNames
         r,←⎕SE.Link.GetItemName¨(⊂path,'/'),¨r[;3]
         :If 0=+/b←≢¨r[;4]
         :AndIf 0<⎕SE.⎕NC'acre'
             b←~b
         :AndIf ∨/b←b∧(⎕C{⊃⊢/⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨r[;3])∊'.aplc' '.apln' '.apli' '.aplf' '.aplo' '.apla' '.charlist' '.charmat' '.charstring' '.dyalog'
             r[⍸b;4]←⎕SE.acre.Itemname(⊂path,'/'),¨b⌿r[;3]
         :EndIf
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
⍝Done
